This directory is intentionally empty.

Vercel requires a static output directory even for a functions-only project;
without it the build fails with "No Output Directory named 'public' found".

It must stay empty. Every request is rewritten to the serverless function in
`api/index.js` (see vercel.json), and Vercel checks for a matching static file
*before* applying a rewrite — so an index.html here would shadow the API's
own `/` route.
